{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07483","headline":"送崔使君赴寿州 · 刘长卿","name":"送崔使君赴寿州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"列郡专城分国忧，彤幨皂盖古诸侯。\n仲华遇主年犹少，公瑾论功位已酬。\n草色青青迎建隼，蝉声处处杂鸣驺。\n千里相思如可见，淮南木叶正惊秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07483.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07483","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}